// ReferencePriorities (on any connectable): its REFERENCE_PRIORITY objects (getChildren: REL_TERMINAL and
// EXT_RP_PRIORITY), one per terminal; invoke(extension, REFERENCE_PRIORITY) starts a new one (fields
// REL_TERMINAL and EXT_RP_PRIORITY, then ACT_ADD returns it), replacing that of its terminal;
// invoke(extension, ACT_DELETE_REFERENCE_PRIORITIES) deletes them. The powsybl helpers:
// evaluate(connectable, EXT_RP_PRIORITY, {} for an injection or {side} for a branch or a 3WT):
// ReferencePriority.get; invoke(connectable, EXT_RP_PRIORITY) starts ReferencePriority.set (fields
// TERMINAL_SIDE for a branch or a 3WT and EXT_RP_PRIORITY, then ACT_ADD); getChildren(network,
// REFERENCE_PRIORITY): ReferencePriorities.get (the priorities above 0, 1 first);
// invoke(network, ACT_DELETE_REFERENCE_PRIORITIES): ReferencePriorities.delete.
IIDM_CODE(REFERENCE_PRIORITIES,           7500)
